===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|physics|lang=en}} A form of [[cyclotron]] in which [[charge]]d [[particle]]s are [[accelerate]]d by an [[electric field]] that is [[synchronized]] with a [[magnetic field]] that keeps them in a [[circular]] path.

====Derived terms====
* [[synchrotron radiation]] / [[synchrotron light]]

